    "transformation": "Artificial Intelligence systems do not consume mined quartz directly. It increases the value of reliable upstream materials only when those materials meet a downstream specification. For metallurgical quartzite, the key is stable furnace feed. For High-Purity Quartz, the key is extremely low impurities, repeatability and customer qualification.",
