   "title": "Czochralski Single-Crystal Ingot Pulling",
   "shortTitle": "CZ ingot pulling",
   "subtitle": "The wafer-start step where ultra-pure silicon is melted and pulled into a monocrystalline ingot, creating the physical starting point for prime semiconductor wafers.",
   "phase": "BOX 02 · SEMICONDUCTOR MATERIALS, TOOLS & WAFER START",
   "phaseId": "02",
