   "executiveNarrative": "Routine Financial Auditing & Basic Bookkeeping is a structurally pressured workflow and task pool within the Roseberg AI value chain. Its relevance comes from how it converts or coordinates standardised digital tasks and process data into capabilities used by the next operating stage. The analytical focus should remain on operational evidence - capacity, quality, utilisation, cost, qualification and customer adoption - rather than on unsupported standalone market-size claims.",
